### Create a new widget
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Widget",
  "description": "This is a test widget created via HTTP request",
  "image": "test-widget.jpg"
}

### Get all widgets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets

### Get widget by ID (replace 1 with actual ID after creation)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/1

### Update a widget (replace 1 with actual ID after creation)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Widget",
  "description": "This widget has been updated via HTTP request",
  "image": "updated-widget.jpg"
}

### Create a widget with missing name (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This widget has a missing name",
  "image": "missing-name.jpg"
}

### Create a widget with missing description (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Missing Description Widget",
  "image": "missing-description.jpg"
}

### Create a widget with missing image (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Missing Image Widget",
  "description": "This widget has a missing image"
}

### Update a widget with missing name (should fail validation)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This updated widget has a missing name",
  "image": "missing-name-update.jpg"
}

### Search widgets by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets?name=updated

### Search widgets by description
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets?description=updated

### Search widgets by both name and description
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets?name=Test&description=updated

### Search widgets on page 2 with size 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/widgets?page=2&size=5
